{
  "_id": "bhBrandCastigat0",
  "name": "Brand of Castigation",
  "ownership": {
    "default": 0
  },
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you damage a creature with a weapon for which you have an active Crimson Rite, you can channel hemocraft magic to sear an arcane brand into that creature (no action required). You always know the direction to the branded creature while it is on the same plane as you. In addition, each time the branded creature deals damage to you or to a creature you can see within 5 feet of you, the branded creature takes Psychic damage equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of 1).</p>\n<p>The brand lasts until you dismiss it (no action required) or until you use this feature to brand a different creature. The brand can be ended by a <em>Dispel Magic</em> spell, treating the brand as a spell whose level equals half your Blood Hunter level (rounded up, maximum of level 9).</p>\n<p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
